# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the Lead page (SELECT to page 4) on the progression page over a chord:
# a legato phrase with a pressed note, as each Preset has it (P1 Swell: Glide 70 ms, Vibrato and Press 100 %); then
# Glide 400 ms; Vibrato 200 %, Press 0; and Sound Reed over P1. Not a test of its own.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap HOME
wait 600
tapkey 0
wait 1500
